[{"s":0,"a":3.2,"d":4.3,"text":"有的任务跑完就该结束，有的要每个节点一份。","f":"5d8f641018.mp3","h":"5d8f641018","r":0},{"s":1,"a":0.6,"d":3.91,"text":"Job 创建 Pod，一直等到它成功退出。","f":"222b1f10a4.mp3","h":"222b1f10a4","r":0},{"s":1,"a":5.6,"d":3.55,"text":"退出码为 0，Job 进入 Complete。","f":"aa7400052c.mp3","h":"aa7400052c","r":0},{"s":1,"a":10.8,"d":4.58,"text":"设了 TTL，结束后自动清理 Job 和 Pod。","f":"5532905841.mp3","h":"5532905841","r":0},{"s":2,"a":0.6,"d":4.58,"text":"失败会重试，间隔 10s、20s 成倍增长。","f":"67884d2dea.mp3","h":"67884d2dea","r":10},{"s":2,"a":5.4,"d":4.06,"text":"重试超过 backoffLimit，Job 判定失败。","f":"2bfb0d8e9e.mp3","h":"2bfb0d8e9e","r":0},{"s":2,"a":10.8,"d":4.13,"text":"Never 每次新建 Pod，失败现场都留着。","f":"94280a9451.mp3","h":"94280a9451","r":0},{"s":3,"a":0.6,"d":3.62,"text":"需要 6 次成功，同时最多跑 2 个。","f":"a2bc9df05e.mp3","h":"a2bc9df05e","r":0},{"s":3,"a":6,"d":4.68,"text":"Indexed Job 给每个 Pod 一个编号，各取一片数据。","f":"58bf8c4b27.mp3","h":"58bf8c4b27","r":0},{"s":3,"a":11.4,"d":4.27,"text":"某片失败重试，新 Pod 还是同一个编号。","f":"8d093de26b.mp3","h":"8d093de26b","r":0},{"s":4,"a":0.6,"d":3.91,"text":"CronJob 按 Cron 表达式，定时创建 Job。","f":"09b4a3aab8.mp3","h":"09b4a3aab8","r":0},{"s":4,"a":5.8,"d":4.01,"text":"上次没跑完又到点了，由并发策略决定。","f":"833da9510e.mp3","h":"833da9510e","r":0},{"s":4,"a":11,"d":4.25,"text":"Forbid 跳过这次，Replace 用新的替换旧的。","f":"0af6a0ad7c.mp3","h":"0af6a0ad7c","r":0},{"s":5,"a":0.6,"d":3.72,"text":"DaemonSet 在每个节点上各跑一个 Pod。","f":"700fc96637.mp3","h":"700fc96637","r":0},{"s":5,"a":5.4,"d":5.23,"text":"加上容忍，控制平面也有；新节点加入自动补上。","f":"286fbc31f7.mp3","h":"286fbc31f7","r":0},{"s":5,"a":10.8,"d":4.99,"text":"更新时逐个节点替换，maxUnavailable 默认 1。","f":"b350ed3347.mp3","h":"b350ed3347","r":0},{"s":6,"a":0.8,"d":4.54,"text":"小结：批处理用 Job，守护进程用 DaemonSet。","f":"6e4cd79f8e.mp3","h":"6e4cd79f8e","r":5},{"s":6,"a":5.6,"d":3.7,"text":"下一课，Ingress 与 Gateway API。","f":"11d1203945.mp3","h":"11d1203945","r":0}]
